{"id":"d99054be830a8adb","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-cor-inaccessible-mods.md","title":"Inaccessible Models","display":"cor-inaccessible-mods — Inaccessible Models","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-inaccessible-mods","aliases":["58-cor-inaccessible-mods"],"display":"cor-inaccessible-mods — Inaccessible Models","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-strongly-inaccessible.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-inaccessible-mods"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-inaccessible-mods</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-inaccessible-mods — Inaccessible Models"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3888033a846b1cd5\" href=\"?note=3888033a846b1cd5\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md\">../batch06/58-df-first-order-language.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7dd94f2e654aefb\" href=\"?note=b7dd94f2e654aefb\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-strongly-inaccessible.md\">../batch17/58-df-strongly-inaccessible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b4fb7c1808c84d14\" href=\"?note=b4fb7c1808c84d14\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md\">../batch06/58-df-measurable-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md\">../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (cardinal candidate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StronglyInaccessible},\\mathrm{Measurable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{StronglyInaccessible},\\mathrm{Measurable}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, applied to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> as in the first two dependencies</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\kappa\">\\(V_\\kappa\\)</span> (cumulative hierarchy level, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"19e9a8c33d5c841c\" href=\"?note=19e9a8c33d5c841c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md\">../batch09/58-df-hierarchy.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in},\\mathcal{M}_{V_\\kappa}\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in},\\mathcal{M}_{V_\\kappa}\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M_{V_\\kappa},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M_{V_\\kappa},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M_{V_\\kappa})=V_\\kappa\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M_{V_\\kappa})=V_\\kappa\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathcal M_{V_\\kappa}}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)=\\{a\\in V_\\kappa^2:a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\">\\(I^{\\mathcal M_{V_\\kappa}}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)=\\{a\\in V_\\kappa^2:a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\in V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\in V\\)</span> is the set of ZFC axiom codes, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}=\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}=\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span>（若出现）取书内公理文件中的句子码集。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}inaccessible\\text{-}models} \\vdash \\operatorname{StronglyInaccessible}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M_{V_\\kappa},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M_{V_\\kappa})=V_\\kappa\\land I^{\\mathcal M_{V_\\kappa}}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)=\\{a\\in V_\\kappa^2:a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\\to\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathcal M_{V_\\kappa},\\mathrm{ZFC})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}inaccessible\\text{-}models} \\vdash \\operatorname{StronglyInaccessible}(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M_{V_\\kappa},\\mathcal L_{\\in})\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M_{V_\\kappa})=V_\\kappa\\land I^{\\mathcal M_{V_\\kappa}}_{\\mathrm{rel},2}(\\dot\\in)=\\{a\\in V_\\kappa^2:a(0)\\in a(1)\\}\\to\\mathrm{Model}(\\mathcal M_{V_\\kappa},\\mathrm{ZFC})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}inaccessible} \\vdash \\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\operatorname{StronglyInaccessible}(\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}measurable\\text{-}inaccessible} \\vdash \\mathrm{Measurable}_S(\\kappa)\\to\\operatorname{StronglyInaccessible}(\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\kappa\">\\(V_\\kappa\\)</span> is a model of ZFC for every strongly inaccessible <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The measurable-cardinal clause records the usual large-cardinal implication, not an arbitrary truth predicate for all formulas.</li>\n<li>The structure and model interfaces are now explicitly typed; the membership interpretation remains part of the antecedent.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"